WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,880 --> 00:00:07,620
This talent is also very strong

2
00:00:11,150 --> 00:00:13,910
How about my talent? Is it okay?

3
00:00:13,910 --> 00:00:15,150
As long as it works well

4
00:00:15,150 --> 00:00:16,910
There will definitely be no shortage of gold coins to spend in the future

5
00:00:16,910 --> 00:00:19,510
It’s not bad that there will be no shortage of supplies.

6
00:00:19,710 --> 00:00:21,310
I've shown you my talent

7
00:00:21,310 --> 00:00:22,550
Show me yours too

8
00:00:22,550 --> 00:00:23,910
Are you sure you want to see it?

9
00:00:23,910 --> 00:00:26,070
If you saw my talent

10
00:00:26,070 --> 00:00:29,240
Then you must become my protector.

11
00:00:29,240 --> 00:00:32,300
I even let you see mine

12
00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:36,130
You actually don't care about me

13
00:00:36,130 --> 00:00:38,330
Anyway, you have seen my talent

14
00:00:38,610 --> 00:00:40,130
You must also let me see yours

15
00:00:40,130 --> 00:00:41,930
Don't worry, I won't tell anyone

16
00:00:41,970 --> 00:00:43,570
On the contrary we can cooperate

17
00:00:43,570 --> 00:00:46,170
Oh, how do you want to cooperate? It's very simple.

18
00:00:46,170 --> 00:00:47,650
All your gold coins are stored with me

19
00:00:47,650 --> 00:00:50,130
Then we divide the daily interest equally and that’s it
